# Settings section surfaces

Use the shared soft gray section background on all Settings module screens so layouts stay symmetrical.

- Section / card surface: `bg-[#F8F9FB]` with `rounded-[8px]`
- Prefer `SettingsBlock` from `SettingsPanel.tsx` when the block needs a title, description, trailing action, or footer
- Untitled sections (e.g. Industry controls) still use the same surface: `rounded-[8px] bg-[#F8F9FB] p-5 sm:p-6` (or `px-5 py-4 sm:px-6 sm:py-5` to match TwoWay `SectionCard`)
- Do **not** invent alternate tinted section backgrounds (e.g. lavender `#F0EDF8`) for settings content cards
- Inner list/table shells on top of a section stay white (`bg-white`) with `border border-[#E4E1EE]` when needed
